    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59188" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρυζ-α</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ης</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mucous discharge from the nostrils, rheum</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				5.253
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορύζης τὴν ῥῖνα μεστός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMort.</u>
					6.2
				</span></i>
			; also, <i>running at the nose</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.107
			</span></i>; in this sense in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.513
			</span></i>; <i>inflammatory nasal catarrh</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.513
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18(2).180
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>drivelling, stupidity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMort.</u>
				20.4
			</span></i>, <u>Hist.</u>
			<i><span class="en">
