				31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Alex.</u>
				20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορύζης καὶ λέμφου ἔμπλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Decl.</u>
					33.29
				</span></i>
			.</div>
